iled\nREDUCED_AXIS = 1\n\nTRANSFORMS = (\n    plgpu.TilingTransform((8, 8 * SWIZZLE // BITWIDTH)),\n    plgpu.SwizzleTransform(SWIZZLE),\n)\n\ndef kernel(_, o_gmem, smem):\n  smem[...] = jnp.zeros(SHAPE)\n  x = smem[...]\n  mean = jnp.sum(x, axis=REDUCED_AXIS)\n  broadcast_dims = tuple(d for d in range(len(SHAPE)) if d != REDUCED_AXIS)\n  o_gmem[...] = x - jax.lax.broadcast_in_dim(mean, SHAPE, broadcast_dims)\n\n\nf = plgpu.kernel(\n    kernel,\n    out_type=jax.ShapeDtypeStruct(SHAPE, jnp.float32),\n    scratch_types=[plgpu.SMEM(SHAPE, jnp.float32, transforms=TRANSFORMS)],\n    compiler_params=plgpu.CompilerParams(\n        lowering_semantics=plgpu.LoweringSemantics.Warpgroup\n    ),\n)\njax.jit(f).trace(jnp.zeros(SHAPE, DTYPE)).lower(lowering_platforms=('cuda',))\n```\n\n### System info (python version, jaxlib version, accelerator, etc.)\n\n```\njax:    0.11.1.dev20260814+ce6cfc5c2b\njaxlib: 0.11.0\nnumpy:  2.5.1\npython: 3.13.5 (main, Jun 12 2025, 12:22:43) [Clang 20.1.4 ]\ndevice info: cpu-1, 1 local devices\"\nprocess_count: 1\nplatform: uname_result(system='Darwin', release='23.5.0', version='Darwin Kernel Version 23.5.0: Wed May  1 20:14:59 PDT 2024; root:xnu-10063.121.3~5/RELEASE_ARM64_T8122', machine='arm64')\n```","closed_at":"2026-09-15T16:13:12Z","closed_by":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61420?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samanklesaria/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samanklesaria/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samanklesaria/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samanklesaria/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/samanklesaria","id":61420,"login":"samanklesaria","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxNDIw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samanklesaria/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samanklesaria/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samanklesaria/repo